# Activity 4 A: swapped open-H and raised physical threshold.
# At shared decision x=0.200 and z=0.750, the forward ray sees near/far H.
# The 4x4 m classroom Floor limits all targets to the physical platform.
# Native contact/range, pupil program and independent oracle remain UNPROVEN.
